== 外す(NSF・GR)→ セッションをやり直す
show ip bgp neighbors 10.255.0.1 | include Graceful Restart Cap|state =
  BGP state = Established, up for 00:00:41
    Graceful Restart Capability: advertised
== M7-5 正解(clear bgp 10.255.0.12 まで)→ 1 回目の Check
show ip bgp neighbors 10.255.0.1 | include Graceful Restart Cap|state =
  BGP state = Established, up for 00:00:40
    Graceful Restart Capability: advertised and received
